{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/10-second-full-gameplay-loop-gif.gif?t=1747115881\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME, UNIT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filthium Zero is a single-player survivor-like action roguelite. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, take on hordes of mutants reanimated by Filthium's corruption, engage in vertical and ground combat, and watch the ragdolls fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: purify water sources by extracting Filthium and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating the hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades their predecessors secured. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward \u2014 one soldier at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAST-PACED GROUND &amp; VERTICAL COMBAT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your barrel from mid-air for a heavy impact, slam down with force, and watch the ragdolls fly. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE SKULL THAT NEVER FORGETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every UNIT is guided by a strange, floating skull \u2014 a persistent assistant who remembers every fallen UNIT. It knows more than you might expect and never leaves your side. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER THE FATE OF LOST UNITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect lost UNIT ID cards and access audio transmissions of their final moments. Some mutants wear fragments of UNIT gear. Others... almost remember how to move like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!<