our barrel from mid-air for a heavy impact, slam down with force, and watch the ragdolls fly. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE SKULL THAT NEVER FORGETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every UNIT is guided by a strange, floating skull \u2014 a persistent assistant who remembers every fallen UNIT. It knows more than you might expect and never leaves your side. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER THE FATE OF LOST UNITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect lost UNIT ID cards and access audio transmissions of their final moments. Some mutants wear fragments of UNIT gear. Others... almost remember how to move like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["NOISE_HUM Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/154735a2246d20faba35962df85899b70b8edc91/header.jpg?t=1747115881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118761,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118761/movie480.mp4?t=1746559238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118761/movie_max.mp4?t=1746559238"},"name":"Filthium Zero: Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118761/20b9d9219ca80c7744b178bcc4adc025ac2eece4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746559238","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118761/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746559238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118761/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746559238"}}],"name":"Filthium Zero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str